+States: `pending` (not started), `in_progress` (actively being worked on), `completed` (finished and verified), `cancelled` (no longer needed).
+
+Rules:
+- Keep exactly one item `in_progress` while work remains, and mark it before starting that work.
+- Update the list in real time rather than batching completions.
+- Mark an item `completed` only after its work is actually done, including any required verification. A blocked or partial item stays `in_progress`, with a follow-up item describing the blocker.
+- Items are specific and actionable; split large work into smaller steps.
